"+    }","+}"],"additions":255,"deletions":7,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpr/docs/ecosystems.md","lines":["@@ -150,8 +150,11 @@ Use a pnpr token as the registry token. `cargo` sends it as a bare"," that is not anonymously readable advertises `auth-required`, so `cargo` sends"," the token on index and download requests too."," ","-Crate names are compared case-insensitively, and an exact `packages:` key must","-be a valid crate name.","+Crate names are compared case-insensitively, with `_` and `-` treated as","+equivalent. An exact `packages:` claim covers both spellings, including when","+the crate has not been published yet. Keys must be valid crate names.","+Use the first published spelling in Cargo dependency declarations and when","+publishing new versions."," "," `cargo search` works against a pnpr registry, matching on crate name over the"," crates it hosts. Each result reports the crate's newest release that is not",""],"additions":5,"deletions":2,"truncated":false}],"additions":347,"deletions":52,"truncated":false,"file_count":10},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-07T15:03:34.277504+00:00"}